# OCS-in-a-Kit Pages: environment variables
#
# The Pages site is static and needs no secrets. Do NOT put API keys here:
# anything the browser needs ships publicly. School settings (school name,
# backend URLs, enabled features) live in the `kit:` block of _config.yml.
#
# AI features (chatbots) call the Flask backend proxy at /api/gemini, so the
# Gemini key belongs in the Flask backend's .env as GEMINI_API_KEY.
#
# Optional local overrides used by the Makefile:
# PORT=4500
# HOST=localhost
